# Byte-pinned fixtures must arrive exactly as committed.
#
# generator._write_text pins newline="\n", and tests/test_ideas_ui.py
# compares generated bytes against these fixtures byte for byte. The Git for
# Windows default (core.autocrlf=true) would check them out as CRLF and fail
# that gate on Windows only, so no conversion is allowed in either direction.
tests/fixtures/** -text

# Build inputs must be checkout-invariant for the same reason: the generator
# copies templates/static/* verbatim into the projection and renders the
# .html templates through _write_text, which pins newline but cannot strip
# \r. A CRLF checkout here leaks straight into dist/ bytes, so the built
# site would differ per platform.
src/planning_control_plane/templates/** -text
